         {
          "text": "Reproduced on QA (admin, Schedule sidebar Filters). Confirmed: no \"Clear all\" in the popover, and the Filters button shows no active-filter count. Matches PRD \u00a75.1 (\"Filter button with an active-count badge\u2026 Clear all resets in one click\"). No new ticket \u2014 covered here.",
