     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Source",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "heading"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Epic SV-8685, story SV-8687 (Work Order Sidebar & Mini Calendar), and the Schedule specification (Confluence page 713031682), version 25.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Section 5.1 (Work order filters): \"Filters live behind a 'Filter' button (with an active-count badge); there are no assignment tabs. Applying a filter narrows the flat card list, and 'Clear all' resets in one click.\" Both missing things \u2014 the count on the button and the one-click reset \u2014 are in that one sentence.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
