      "self": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=712020%3A67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba",
      "timeZone": "America/Bogota"
     },
     "body": "<p>Reproduced on QA (admin, Schedule sidebar Filters). Confirmed: no \"Clear all\" in the popover, and the Filters button shows no active-filter count. Matches PRD \u00a75.1 (\"Filter button with an active-count badge\u2026 Clear all resets in one click\"). No new ticket \u2014 covered here.</p>\n\n<p><div class=\"embeddedObject\"><object classid=\"clsid:02BF25D5-8C17-4B23-BC80-D3488ABDDC6B\" codebase=\"https://www.apple.com/qtactivex/qtplugin.cab\" data=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/59392?stream=true\" height=\"380\" type=\"video/mp4\" width=\"742\" ><param name=\"data\" value=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/59392?stream=true\"/><param name=\"src\" value=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/59392?stream=true\"/><param name=\"type\" value=\"video/mp4\"/><embed height=\"380\" pluginspage=\"https://www.apple.com/quicktime/download/\" src=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/59392?stream=true\" type=\"video/mp4\" width=\"742\" /></object></div></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://shopview.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e\" data-account-id=\"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e\" accountid=\"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Bilal Muzamil</a> <a href=\"https://shopview.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A92c46428-d353-4811-9672-e47eeb410d09\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"712020:92c46428-d353-4811-9672-e47eeb410d09\" data-account-id=\"712020:92c46428-d353-4811-9672-e47eeb410d09\" accountid=\"712020:92c46428-d353-4811-9672-e47eeb410d09\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Branko Cicovic</a> </p>",
