      "timeZone": "America/Bogota"
     },
     "body": "<p>Verified fixed on QA (build v3.5+, 2026-08-06). Filters popover now shows \"Clear all,\" the Filters button shows an active-filter count badge, and per-row counts render. Matches PRD \u00a75.1. Marking as Done.</p>\n\n<p><div class=\"embeddedObject\"><object classid=\"clsid:02BF25D5-8C17-4B23-BC80-D3488ABDDC6B\" codebase=\"https://www.apple.com/qtactivex/qtplugin.cab\" data=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/59397?stream=true\" height=\"380\" type=\"video/mp4\" width=\"742\" ><param name=\"data\" value=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/59397?stream=true\"/><param name=\"src\" value=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/59397?stream=true\"/><param name=\"type\" value=\"video/mp4\"/><embed height=\"380\" pluginspage=\"https://www.apple.com/quicktime/download/\" src=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/59397?stream=true\" type=\"video/mp4\" width=\"742\" /></object></div></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://shopview.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e\" data-account-id=\"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e\" accountid=\"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Bilal Muzamil</a> I don\u2019t have the option to mark as Done but I have verified this on QA.</p>",
